# ms-copilot-vault — only track agent-critical text files
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!copilot-instructions.md
!user.md
!memory.md
!bootstrap.ps1
!vault.config.json
# Shared engine, kept identical across vaults by core/scripts/Sync-Core.ps1
!core/
!core/**
!scripts/
!scripts/*.ps1
!archive/
!archive/*.md
!archive/_legacy/
!archive/_legacy/*.md
# Self-improving vault: capture queue. Track pending lessons (top-level *.md)
# so they propagate across sessions; processed/ and rejected/ stay local-only.
!inbox/
!inbox/*.md
# Projects: long-running initiative charters. Synced (durable) unlike handoffs/.
!projects/
!projects/*.md
# Handoffs: session continuity. OPEN handoffs + index.md sync (cross-machine
# resume + machine-loss recovery); DONE handoffs are moved to handoffs/_done/
# by `qdone` and stay local-only (not pushed). _done/ is NOT un-ignored below.
!handoffs/
!handoffs/*.md

# Per-launch vault-gate sentinel written by the copilot() profile wrapper
.vault-checked.json
